category: Libs
build-depends: cygport gobject-introspection gtk-doc libgdk_pixbuf2.0-devel libgirepository1.0-devel libglib2.0-devel libgtk3-devel libgtop2.0-devel libstartup-notification1-devel libwnck3-devel libX11-devel python3-devel python312-lxml vala
sdesc: "Window matching library (utilities)"
ldesc: "Removes the headache of applications matching into a simple DBus
daemon and c wrapper library. Currently features application matching at amazing
levels of accuracy (covering nearly every corner case)."
